clinical note: This will be a phase 1/2a, open-label, single-center study with 3 periods. The aims of the study are to:

1. evaluate the dose-response curve following ascending single doses of TSX-011;
2. confirm optimum dosing conditions;
3. evaluate the efficacy of single or multiple daily adaptive dosing; and
4. evaluate the safety and tolerability of TSX-011. condition: gonadal disorders

